---
source: misc/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"lslocks\")"
---
List local system locks

Usage: lslocks [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -b, --bytes            Print SIZE in bytes rather than human-readable format
  -J, --json             Use JSON output format
  -i, --noinaccessible   Ignore locks without read permissions on the file
  -n, --noheadings       Don't print headings
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Define which output columns to use
      --output-all       Output all available columns
  -p, --pid <pid>        Display only locks held by this PID
  -r, --raw              Use the raw output format
  -u, --notruncate       Don't truncate text in columns
  -h, --help             Print help
